  "releaseNotes": "2.1.0 (shared version with EfCore.BaseRepositoryPack, no breaking changes): unit of work across entities with transactions and cancellable saves, update without saving, set-based DeleteWhereAsync/UpdateWhereAsync, split query / ignore query filters / identity resolution options, StreamAsync, keyset pagination and page navigation flags, fluent specification builder with And/Or/Not predicates, LongCountAsync, ExecuteCommandInterpolatedAsync, faster assembly-scan registration and primary key checks through the EF Core model. See CHANGELOG.",
